    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16937" root="رهو" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَهَآءٌ</span></b>  A <i>wide</i> place. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A wide tract of
land:</i> (S, TA:) or <i>what is wide</i> of land: (M,
TA:) [or] <i>an even tract of land, seldom free from
the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرَاب</span> [or <i>mirage</i>]: (JK, TA:) and <i>what is
even</i> of anything. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَهْوٌ</span>, as applied to a woman. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  It is also [app. <i>A hue,</i> or <i>a
haze,</i>] <i>like dust-colour and smoke.</i> (TA.)

